// Dialog :
"P1836811510" "And that's that. The stolen technology should be quite useful. Our jump bots should be much improved once we've reverse-engineered it. Sadly, though, you're a bit too hot a contract for us to continue with right now. Don't want to tip our hand to your part in all of this, it could cause a terrible mess for both of us. It was good working with you, though. I'm certain you'll make quite a name for yourself."
// RandomFameString :
"P3813379268" "I heard a rumor that {VillainName} set up the battle between Wyvern and the Council for a profit. What a cunning fiend!"

